 "notes": "Old flat models Fender Stratocaster/Telecaster, Gibson Les Paul/SG became archetypes; generic S-type, T-type, single-cut, double-cut, V-type, Explorer-type moved to 't'. Superstrat added as maker-free archetype. Left out: Gretsch Electromatic semis, Gibson Firebird I/III/VII, Ibanez Genesis reissues, Benedetto model names (La Venezia etc.), Epiphone Elitist/Revolution Casinos — not confirmed on retrieved pages. Wikipedia API rate-limited (429), so all sources are WebFetch'd Wikipedia articles; Benedetto_Guitars 404, used Robert_Benedetto. Brand facts for Fender, Gibson, Epiphone, Squier, Gretsch, Rickenbacker, Ibanez, Jackson, Charvel, Kramer, ESP, Schecter, Yamaha from knowledge (s=knowledge); Charvel founding year omitted (unsure)."
